<section class="rt-faq-section" id="RtProductFAQ">
  <div class="rt-faq-container">
    <div class="rt-faq-header">
      <span class="rt-section-badge">IMMEDIATE RESOLUTION</span>
      <h2 class="rt-faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="rt-faq-sub">Everything you need to know about delivery, sizing, and guarantees.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-faq-grid">
      <details class="rt-faq-item" open>
        <summary class="rt-faq-question">
          <span>When will my order be dispatched and delivered?</span>
          <span class="rt-faq-chevron">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="rt-faq-answer">
          <p>Orders are dispatched within 24 hours via express air couriers (Bluedart, Delhivery, Xpressbees). Delivery typically takes 2 to 3 days for metro cities, and 3 to 5 business days across the rest of India. You will receive an SMS and WhatsApp update with your live tracking number as soon as the package ships.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="rt-faq-item">
        <summary class="rt-faq-question">
          <span>How does Cash on Delivery (COD) work?</span>
          <span class="rt-faq-chevron">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="rt-faq-answer">
          <p>Cash on Delivery is 100% available with zero upfront advance payment. When the delivery courier arrives at your location, you can choose to pay with physical Cash or scan the courier's dynamic UPI QR code (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm). There are zero hidden fees.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="rt-faq-item">
        <summary class="rt-faq-question">
          <span>Can I easily adjust the strap / bracelet size at home?</span>
          <span class="rt-faq-chevron">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="rt-faq-answer">
          <p>Yes, all metal steel bracelets feature an easy-adjust sliding lock clasp that fits wrist sizes from 5.5 to 8.5 inches. You can unlock and adjust it in seconds using a coin, key, or small flat tool with no trip to a jeweler required.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="rt-faq-item">
        <summary class="rt-faq-question">
          <span>What is your 30-Day Hassle-Free Replacement Guarantee?</span>
          <span class="rt-faq-chevron">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="rt-faq-answer">
          <p>If your timepiece arrives damaged in transit or develops an operational defect, we immediately send you a brand-new replacement unit at no extra charge. Simply message our WhatsApp hotline at +91 9211297090 with your order number and a quick photo.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="rt-faq-item">
        <summary class="rt-faq-question">
          <span>How can I reach customer support if I need assistance?</span>
          <span class="rt-faq-chevron">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="rt-faq-answer">
          <p>Our concierge support is active Monday through Saturday, 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM IST. You can call or WhatsApp us directly at <strong>+91 9211297090</strong>, or email us at <strong>q21qq12q@gmail.com</strong>. Retrotick.in is owned and operated by Dabh India.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

